; The printed marks. Each texture is a 128 square with the cap filling the frame
; (Tools/gen_wii_face_marks.py), so a quad the width of the cap prints the mark at
; the size the CONTROLS diagram draws it — same drawing, same proportion.
;
; ALPHA_SCISSOR and not ALPHA: solid ink needs no gradient, and scissor keeps
; these in the OPAQUE pass where they write depth. A transparent decal 0.1 mm off
; a cap is a sorting question nobody wants to answer seven times per remote.
[sub_resource type="QuadMesh" id="Quad_mark_power"]
size = Vector2(0.005, 0.005)

