; POWER, in the TOP LEFT CORNER where the hardware puts it — about 9 mm in from
; the left edge and 8 mm down from the tip, on the same side as MINUS below it
; (-X is the player's left when the barrel points at the set). A VRButton like the
; face caps rather than a bare mesh: it is worked by a finger and nothing else, so
; it needs the poke volume. Nothing binds to it and it reaches no core;
; wiimote.gd reads how long it is HELD.
[node name="PowerButton" type="Area3D" parent="."]
